  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your allies can amplify your abilities when coordinating.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Knowledge of at least one technique.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When multiple characters work together to perform a multi-character technique and all of them possess this feat, the technique’s complexity is reduced by 3 for each participant beyond the first rather than 2.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/techniques#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
